{"t": 1794110318.0229025, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline fix (main): `test:contract` was failing because `billing.invoice.invoice_number()` still produced the legacy unpadded sequence \u2014 `invoice_number(2026, 42)` returned `INV-2026-42` \u2014 while the contract test requires the ERP v2 format with a 6-digit zero-padded sequence (`INV-2026-000042`, FIN-77).\n\nI updated `billing/invoice.py` to format the sequence with `:06d`. Verified locally: `invoice_number(2026, 42)` now returns `INV-2026-000042`, so the contract test passes and the main-branch pipeline is green. This is the same ERP v2 format this MR introduces.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
